###Login(마스터)
POST http://localhost:19090/api/users/signIn
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "master",
  "password": "Abcd1234!"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken);
  client.log("accessToken : " + client.global.get("accessToken"));
%}

